category: Devel
build-depends: cygport mingw64-i686-plutovg mingw64-i686-freetype2
sdesc: "Tiny SVG rendering library in C for Win32 toolchain"
ldesc: "PlutoSVG is a compact and efficient SVG rendering
 library written in C. It is specifically designed for parsing
 and rendering SVG documents embedded in OpenType fonts, providing
 an optimal balance between speed and minimal memory usage.
 It is also suitable for rendering scalable icons."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/sammycage/plutosvg
license: MIT
